vely young girl falls from the sky and directly into his lap. He has no time to react as she is being chased by villains known as the Black Lodge, intent on killing and claiming her true form. Kurou witnesses her use magic and save his life from the bullets fired towards his car. When a crazy-psychotic doctor begins firing with heavy weaponry, Kurou is able to speed away in his car, taking the strange girl with him. The doctor discovers them just as the young girl decides to turn the tables.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81105/373774.jpg"},{"title":"Evil Shine","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4021","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1067","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1067","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"44509","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81105","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"98521","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81105/373775.jpg"},{"title":"Reaninator","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4021","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1067","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1067","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"44509","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81105","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"98522","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81105/373776.jpg"},{"title":"The Invaders","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4021","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1067","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1067","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"44509","scope":"s1","se